      "id": "claim_5927923fe6f7427e9d806188da745c32",
      "statement": "The CommerceLens Order Service is a checkout coordinator built with Java 21, Spring Boot 3.4.2, PostgreSQL, and RabbitMQ. Its entry point is OrderApplication.java and it listens on port 8080. Ownership is evidenced by Maven groupId com.commercelens and artifactId order-service version 0.1.0.",
