          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f31ec485ddcd625226694060a7b160058c09a194f88788718f875f7dc2b09bdf:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_a7de5a3c964848aaa07792299841bd7b",
      "statement": "The checkout saga advances orders through states: pending → reserved → payment_unknown → paid → confirmed. Terminal failure branches are failed (definite 4xx declines after compensation) and manual_review (5xx, timeouts, or compensation failures).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/com/commercelens/orders/Checkout.java#L39-L59",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:16e05e280b160f29b08d231a479a8c601198dc5c372b69812fcbb6c314a1b37c:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_c72f57f6a973402ebcd1666914e512b5",
      "statement": "Outbound HTTP calls from RemoteServices use an 8-second request timeout and a 2-second connect timeout. The coordinator does not blindly retry after uncertain outcomes.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/com/commercelens/orders/RemoteServices.java#L16-L20",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9c94c7ae2ced90ede8288aa680238a5507b0a55636b9eca2d9f91a552657d72c:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_8210be24d98748ba87c788ead2628ceb",
      "statement": "On payment decline (402), the saga releases the inventory reservation. On definite shipping rejection (4xx), it refunds payment and releases stock. If compensation (refund or release) fails, the order transitions to manual_review.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/com/commercelens/orders/Checkout.java#L46-L59",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:65d280a048c384f86d52b8fdb16fe866c47d761fc0ec107f70bd7e9e0000dd05:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_2bcee1eeac4049ff80c433001b6c1cd3",
      "statement": "The service persists orders in PostgreSQL table orders with JSONB body, unique idempotency_key, request_hash, and http_status. Confirmed orders atomically insert into order_outbox for later RabbitMQ publication.",
